# Release Log — alice branch (changes from 0.1-alpha)

## bullet_render

1 commit, 16 files changed, +1250 / -1 lines.

### New files — isaac/ module

- `isaac/main.py` (161 lines)
  Isaac Sim 6.2 render-only backend entry point. Launched via python.sh by
  the bullet_drone IsaacRenderer.

- `isaac/camera.py` (40 lines)
  RTX camera adapter matching the Bullet FLU pose/RGBA interface.
  Converts orientation conventions between Bullet body frame and USD camera.

- `isaac/scene.py` (247 lines)
  In-memory USD world builder. Creates target geometry, spectator camera
  marker, and loads world files.

- `isaac/scenario.py` (147 lines)
  Truck geometry and contact lifecycle. Sphere-sweep collision detection,
  independent of USD/GPU.

- `isaac/transport.py` (152 lines)
  Bounded ZMQ + shared-memory transport. Subscribes to pose/config telemetry
  from the launcher's RenderPublisher, publishes camera images back via SHM.

- `isaac/surface.py` (47 lines)
  Vertical surface queries over world-space triangles. Pure geometry, no
  USD/GPU/numpy imports.

- `isaac/presets.py` (17 lines)
  Per-world defaults (spawn and target positions). Reads world_presets.json.

- `isaac/runtime.py` (11 lines)
  Runtime location helpers shared by the renderer and its launch probes.

- `isaac/world_presets.json` (6 lines)
  Preset config for rivermark.usd (spawn and target coordinates).

### New files — tests

- `tests/test_isaac_camera.py` — camera axis convention preservation
- `tests/test_isaac_presets.py` — world preset validation
- `tests/test_isaac_scenario.py` — contact geometry and confirmation logic
- `tests/test_isaac_surface.py` — vertical surface height queries
- `tests/test_isaac_transport.py` — real TCP and SHM transport boundary checks

### New files — tools

- `tools/check_truck_color.py` (122 lines)
  Captures one frame from the running Isaac renderer and reports the truck's
  HSV range. Used for tuning bullet_visual color detection thresholds.

### Modified files

- `pyproject.toml`
  Updated description to include Isaac Sim. Added `isaac` dependency group
  (pyzmq, bullet-simulation-protocol, bullet-image-transport). Added workspace
  source paths for the two bullet_drone libs.
